                                                "sense_id": "d4510985-66ea-3f71-9e21-8731ee5b8b7f",
                                                "text": "[O]ne streak of copper-coloured light made a narrow rent between sea and sky."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "608a4261-731e-4991-9522-4c1a41bdc394",
                                                "sense_id": "d4510985-66ea-3f71-9e21-8731ee5b8b7f",
                                                "text": "The brown paint on the door was so old that the naked wood showed between the rents."
                                            },
                                            {
